one" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"></rect><path d="M22 8l-6 4 6 4z"></path></svg></span><h3>Video streaming</h3><p class="muted">Official videos, live sessions and documentaries, each with its own page, rating and reviews.</p><a class="more" href="videos.html">Watch videos<svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20M12 2a15 15 0 000 20"></path></svg></span><h3>Regional language catalogue</h3><p class="muted">English, Urdu, Hindi, Punjabi and Sindhi today. Our team adds new languages as the catalogue grows.</p><a class="more" href="browse.html">Browse by language<svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 7 7 .6-5.3 4.7 1.6 7.2L12 17.8 5.7 21.5l1.6-7.2L2 9.6 9 9z"></path></svg></span><h3>Ratings and reviews</h3><p class="muted">Registered listeners rate from 1 to 5 stars and write reviews they can edit later.</p><a class="more" href="register.html">Create an account<svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0014 0M12 18v4"></path></svg></span><h3>Artist promotion</h3><p class="muted">Release spotlights, launch campaigns and a flashing New badge on fresh uploads for their first seven days.</p><a class="more" href="portfolio.html">See our work<svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article><article class="svc rv in"><span class="ico"><svg class="ic" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7z"></path><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Curated collections</h3><p class="muted">Move from one favourite to the next by album, artist, year or genre.</p><a class="more" href="browse.html">Open collections<svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></article></div></div></section><section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="sh rv in"><div><span class="kicker">Process</span><h2>From file to front page in four steps</h2></div></div><div class="steps"><div class="step rv in"><span class="num">1</span><h3>Send us your release</h3><p class="muted">Share the audio or video file with its title, artist, album, year, genre and language.</p></div><div class="step rv in"><span class="num">2</span><h3>We prepare the page</h3><p class="muted">Our team adds cover art, a description and the right categories so listeners can find it.</p></div><div class="step rv in"><span class="num">3</span><h3>Publish with a New badge</h3><p class="muted">The release appears on the home page with a flashing New badge for its first week.</p></div><div class="step rv in"><span class="num">4</span><h3>Listeners rate and review</h3><p class="muted">Registered users add ratings and reviews, and you see how the release is received.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap narrow-wrap"><div class="sh rv in"><div><span class="kicker">FAQ</span><h2>Questions we hear often</h2></div></div><div class="faq"><details class="rv in"><summary>Do I need an account to listen or watch?<svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="muted">You can browse the whole catalogue without an account. You need to register to rate or review.</p></details><details class="rv in"><summary>Which languages are available?<svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="muted">English, Urdu, Hindi, Punjabi and Sindhi at the moment. Administrators can add more in the dashboard.</p></details><details class="rv in"><summary>Can I change my rating or review later?<svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="muted">Yes. Open the title, click a different star or edit your review text and save.</p></details><details class="rv in"><summary>How does the New badge work?<svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="muted">Every release added in the last seven days shows a flashing New badge on its card and in the dashboard.</p></details><details class="rv in"><summary>How do artists get their work listed?<svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="muted">Use the contact page with the subject "Artist submission" and our team will reply by email.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap rv in"><h2>Have a release to share?</h2><p>Tell us about it and our team will reply by email.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn pri lg" href="contact.html">Send a submission</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="foot"><div class="wrap"><div class="fgrid"><div><a class="logo" href="index.html"><i><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b></i>SOUND</a><p>New and old songs and videos, in English and your own language.</p></div><div><h4>Library</h4><a href="music.html">Music</a><a href="videos.html">Videos</a><a href="browse.html">Browse</a><a href="gallery.html">Gallery</a></div><div><h4>Company</h4><a href="about.html">About us</a><a href="services.html">Services</a><a href="portfolio.html">Portfolio</a><a href="blog.html">Blog and news</a></